  "description": "A light-weight ORM for .NET that doesn't hide the database. Map tables to C# types, get CRUD and\n      result mapping, and write the SQL yourself with tables, columns and expressions as compile-checked C#\n      identifiers. Runs on any ADO.NET DbConnection: SQL Server, MySQL, PostgreSQL and Oracle.",
